    "context_cancellation_analysis": "MATHEMATICAL PROOF: Under lossless STE, recovered residual is delta_rec = (HH_drop + gamma * P) - C(HH_keep). Since in the forward pass HH_drop is synthesized as C(HH_keep), delta_rec simplifies to gamma * P. Because C cancels out algebraically in delta_rec, d(L_bit)/d(C) = 0 under lossless conditions. Consequently, BitRecoveryLoss yields EXACTLY 0.0 gradient for ContextPredictorCNN. This proves that ContextPredictionLoss is mathematically required to supervise the ContextPredictorCNN."
